{"id":"dad7e17cfa2772ae","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-finite-computation-approximation.md","title":"Finite Computation Stages","display":"df-finite-computation-approximation — Finite Computation Stages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-finite-computation-approximation","aliases":["68-df-finite-computation-approximation"],"display":"df-finite-computation-approximation — Finite Computation Stages","depends_on":["[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§8.4 p.23 and §14 p.49 / PDF 32,58; explicit finite-stage variant","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-finite-computation-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-finite-computation-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-computation-approximation — Finite Computation Stages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2517b868f96ae323\" href=\"?note=2517b868f96ae323\" title=\"68-df-kleene-t-predicate\">68-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.4 p.23 and §14 p.49 / PDF 32,58; explicit finite-stage variant"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,k,s\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,k,s\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k,U\">\\(T_k,U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2517b868f96ae323\" href=\"?note=2517b868f96ae323\" title=\"68-df-kleene-t-predicate\">68-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e^{(k)}\">\\(W_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。有限元组逐分量的界用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;k\">\\(\\forall i&lt;k\\)</span> 表示。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)},W_{e,s}^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)},W_{e,s}^{(k)}\\)</span> 为以下引入的阶段对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:(\\forall i&lt;k\\;x_i\\le s)\\land\\exists c\\le s\\;(T_k(e,\\vec x,c)\\land U(c)=y)\\},\\quad W_{e,s}^{(k)}:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)}),\\quad W_{e,s}:=W_{e,s}^{(1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)}:=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:(\\forall i&lt;k\\;x_i\\le s)\\land\\exists c\\le s\\;(T_k(e,\\vec x,c)\\land U(c)=y)\\},\\quad W_{e,s}^{(k)}:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)}),\\quad W_{e,s}:=W_{e,s}^{(1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_{e,s}^{(k)}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}^{(k)},\\quad |W_{e,s}^{(k)}|&lt;\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_{e,s}^{(k)}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}^{(k)},\\quad |W_{e,s}^{(k)}|&lt;\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 8.4（p.23 / PDF p.32）及 §14 的 W_{e,s}（p.49 / PDF p.58）。本节点采用 ≤s 并显式加输入界，原书采用 &lt;s 的计算编号界，故不是声称阶段编号逐数相同。每阶段只有有限输入候选，有限记录检验可判定；界随 s 增长，最终包含每个真实停机记录。oracle 阶段在 oracle 改变时可反复变化，不能把此处的单调性移植到 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"124259d2584af1b6\" href=\"?note=124259d2584af1b6\" title=\"68-df-oracle-computation\">68-df-oracle-computation</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"2517b868f96ae323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":""