\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)}),\\quad W_{e,s}:=W_{e,s}^{(1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\varphi_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_e^{(k)}=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathbb N}W_{e,s}^{(k)},\\quad W_{e,s}^{(k)}\\subseteq W_{e,s+1}^{(k)},\\quad |W_{e,s}^{(k)}|<\\aleph_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1940,"backlinks":[{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f416b894b72b070a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$、$\\mathrm{HyperSimple}$ 分别见 [[68-df-simple-set]]、[[68-df-hypersimple-set]]。$W_{e,s}$ 的有限单调枚举见 [[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-computation-approximation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-computation-approximation|df-finite-computation-approximation — Finite Computation Stages]]"}],"outgoing":["bca7d0eca4017dc7","2517b868f96ae323","913d52943499d039","124259d2584af1b6"]}